  <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
  <h1>Cells interlinked within one stem.</h1>

  <p>asystemofcells is a family of small, quiet, on-device apps, built by one solo maker rather than a company. Each app is its own thing, with its own design language where that makes sense, but they all share the same house rules.</p>

  <h2>How the house is organized</h2>
  <p>Every app belongs to one of four cell types, by what it's for rather than what it looks like:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Daily cells</strong> - tools you'd reach for every day.</li>
    <li><strong>Ambient cells</strong> - apps that sit in the background and stay out of your way.</li>
    <li><strong>Maker cells</strong> - apps for building and shipping things.</li>
    <li><strong>Connective tissue</strong> - the shared plumbing that lets the rest of the house work.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>On-device by default</h2>
  <p>Nothing runs in a cloud you didn't choose. Every app computes on your phone first. Where an app offers an optional cloud feature, that's opt-in per use and clearly marked, never a hidden fallback.</p>

  <h2>No telemetry in the apps. Page counts on this site, and nowhere you work.</h2>
  <p>Zero telemetry in every app in the house. Not a setting you have to find and turn off - it was never wired in.</p>
  <p>This website makes a smaller claim, and states it exactly. Pages that describe the house, like this one, count how many people looked at them: no cookies, no tracking between sites or between days, no profile of you. Pages where you actually do something - the <a class="inline-link" href="/nooz/read">reader</a> and the <a class="inline-link" href="/tools">generators</a> - measure nothing at all, and cannot, because they are static files the page templates never touch. The <a class="inline-link" href="/privacy">privacy policy</a> spells out exactly what is collected and what is not.</p>

  <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
  <p>
    <a class="inline-link" href="https://mdhv.xyz" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">mdhv.xyz</a> is the making-of: the design thinking and build notes behind this house.
    <a class="inline-link" href="https://asystemofcells.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">asystemofcells.dev</a> is the builder-facing surface, for anyone working on the plumbing itself.
  </p>
